tip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a></b>, Turn in 5&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendations: Purple Dragon Knights</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the Purple Dragon Knights. You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +7</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +7</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Insightful Strength +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Insightful Strength +2</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +2 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +15</a>:</b> Passive: +15 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Purple_Dragon_Helm.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Purple_Dragon_Helm.png/420px-Purple_Dragon_Helm.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"352\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Purple_Dragon_Helm.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This helmet is of the same make as those worn by the famed Purple Dragon Knights of Cormyr.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817215255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.138 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4493/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27350/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10030/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 12/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n114.17%  138.744     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  121.522      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  121.522      1 -total\n 95.10%  115.572      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 37.96%   46.129      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.90%   44.842      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.13%   43.900      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 35.37%   42.984      2 Template:InCategory\n 25.94%   31.523      7 Template:Popup\n 15.65%   19.019      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24220-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817215255 and revision id 634072. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
